I had a DEC5000/2xx, and it drove a DEC VRT19-HA monitor, though I do not
remember which graphics option it had.

If you can find an Iiyama, Sony, or older Viewsonic monitor (I have not seen
the BNC jacks on recent models), it should work.  I use Iiyamas myself, and
they work with ANYTHING.  Others have mentioned Hitachi as well.

