keyboard problems, so don't assume that just
the VT220 went south.

If the LK201 is bad, I look at it as one of two
major problems.  The keyboard has gotten
some gunk down inside and fouled up the
key matrix or the logic board has gone bad.
Usually it is the matrix and the LK201 is
difficult to clean.  I have yet to see the logic
board go bad.  I have a few spare logic boards
if that turns out to be the case for yours and
you want to replace it.

Mike



