tiger         Pentium II PC          350 MHz   333   N/A     N/A   N/A  
woodpecker    Sun SPARCstation 20  2x125 MHz  1035   FAIL    FAIL  FAIL


CACHE + RAM SIZES - Cache data might not be 100% accurate.
hostname      Machine                      RAM             Cache
-----------------------------------------------------------
